/* Default base-layer keyboard mapping: physical key ID -> USB HID usage.
 * Keyboard/Keypad page; E0..E7 are modifiers, 00 is no keyboard output.
 * Fn actions are separate and immutable. Shared by this board's layouts.
 * Edit this configuration, not scanner or USB report code. */
